    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the tax law, in relation to providing taxpayer gifts for gun\nviolence research; and to amend the state finance law, in relation to\nestablishing the gun violence research fund",
    "basePrintNo": "S5952",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S5952-2021",
